<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<chapter xml:id="ch-season10" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Season 10: Systems of Equations</title>

  <introduction>
    <p> 
        A system of equations consists of two or more equations that need to be true simultaneously. 
        A solution to a system of equations is something that makes all the equations true at the same time. 
      </p>
        </introduction>
